        "scenario": "A synthetic walkthrough finds a protocol conformance error, an unavailable imported module, and a compiling test target with no run result. A reviewer points to the installed compiler version as the explanation for all three.",
        "androidBridge": "Android signature checking, Gradle module resolution, and JUnit discovery are separate diagnostic boundaries too. Swift tools declarations and Xcode scheme actions have their own roles; a Kotlin compiler or Gradle version analogy does not determine another Swift target's effective language mode.",
