        "scenario": "A synthetic editor seeds State from an initializer argument. Its identity remains stable when the parent changes the record. A proposed fix attaches a newly generated UUID on every body evaluation, which starts erasing typing.",
        "androidBridge": "Compose remember(initialInput) keys can help reason about deliberate resets, but SwiftUI uses its own hierarchy and explicit identity rules. Neither remembered state nor State automatically follows every changed constructor argument or survives process death without a separate restoration mechanism.",
