        "androidBridge": "Android Keystore primarily exposes protected cryptographic key operations, while Apple Keychain can store password-like items and keys. Secure Enclave operations are a separate capability; Kotlin null or an exception analogy must not collapse Keychain OSStatus access failures into item absence.",
