        "androidBridge": "Kotlin Compose WindowInsets consumption suggests tracing inset ownership. UIKit safe areas, scroll adjustment, and keyboardLayoutGuide have distinct contracts; they do not follow Compose inset-consumption rules or automatically describe a floating keyboard.",
