        "answerHTML": "\u003cp>The root owns one observable draft in State and the picker and Review receive that same reference. Choosing a topic commits it; Cancel closes without assignment. Review eligibility derives from trimmed name and a present topic. Reset clears fields and revokes old suggestion publication. The root-associated task awaits an injected synthetic service, while a token independently guards both success and failure. No store is included, so process restart has no draft-preservation promise.\u003c/p>\u003cp>Model tests belong in the hosted unit-test target with the correct app module import. UI tests belong in their separate product and verify actual controls, routing and reset interaction. Type checking covers declarations and API assumptions under a compiler/SDK; a linked build, simulator launch, executed tests and assistive inspection add separate evidence. A good handoff lists actual results and pending layers rather than calling every authored example verified execution.\u003c/p>",
