        "kind": "Design",
        "prompt": "Choose between a coordinated local document and CloudKit record sync for a small cross-device draft feature.",
        "scenario": "The team wants offline edits, external document-provider access, older client compatibility and retry after lost acknowledgments.",
        "minutes": 15,
        "androidBridge": "Compare a Room/outbox plus Android document-provider workflow; Apple's document coordination, iCloud identity and schema evolution are separate mechanisms.",
