        "scenario": "The user selects the emoji; an asynchronous validation result arrives while an IME composition is active.",
        "minutes": 10,
        "androidBridge": "Kotlin/Java String length uses UTF-16; Swift String indices and Character iteration have different semantics, while both platforms require composition-aware editing.",
